  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM Iraq - Contribute to the Economic Recovery of Iraq Through Employment Creation and Revitalization of Local Economies (Phase V)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase V of IOM&#x2019;s collaboration with KfW will continue to promote sustainable livelihoods in post-conflict Iraq. The overall objective of the proposed programme is to contribute to the economic recovery of Iraq through employment creation and revitalisation of local economies and the livelihoods of internally displaced persons (IDPs), returnees, and host communities.</narrative>
  </description>
